    "featureId": "starstone:network",
    "id": "starstone:network/extending",
    "text": "To extend a circuit, mount Surface Cable directly on the generator and continue a joined run across full supporting blocks to a lamp. Neighboring surface parts must meet along the same mounting surface. Cables, lamps, bridges and adapters also meet around an outside edge of a support, such as a lamp on top of a block and a cable on its side; use an Inner Corner for an inside bend."
  },
