      }
    ],
    "featureId": "starstone:network",
    "id": "starstone:network/check-connections",
    "text": "If a lamp stays dark, first check that a generator is on or a Redstone Input is receiving power. Follow the cable run and check that each part still has a full support and meets the next part on the same surface. A Conduit connects through its two ends, not its sides: run the cable into an end, or break and replace the conduit using the desired end face. An Isolated Bridge keeps its crossing lanes separate; continue along the powered lane instead of expecting power to turn onto the other lane."
  }
